    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://ontology.unifiedcyberontology.org/uco/observable/SmartDevice"/>
    <core:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Base station collected at the scene. At the forensic laboratory, a bootloader memory image and an archive of a folder of interest were acquired from this base station. No corresponding data source is present under data/, so no telemetry has been extracted or parsed by this pipeline.</core:description>
