    <core:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Observed at the scene. No acquisition action or corresponding data source is recorded for this device by this pipeline (not to be confused with the Nest Protect smoke detector, which is covered by NestRdfExport).</core:description>
